   "id": "sec2-12",
   "section": "Career",
   "text": "On 10 September 2025, DC announced that they had canceled the Red Hood series just one day after its debut, following posts made by Felker-Martin on Bluesky regarding the assassination of Charlie Kirk including \"Hope the bullet’s okay after touching Charlie Kirk\" and \"Thoughts and prayers you Nazi bitch\".",
